 The Rust crates have no Solidity helpers. The Solidity verifier contracts and the functions that
format proofs for them ship with the TypeScript packages; switch to TypeScript to see them. The TypeScript packages can also format a proof for the Solidity verifier contracts
(MerkleForgeBinary, MerkleForgeSparse) in
